  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">I4Policy Start-ups training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to contribute to the Netherlands embassy in Tanzania&apos;s ongoing initiative to support the enabling environment for start-ups in Tanzania. In light of the recent appointment of the Steering Committee for the Start-up Act Roadmap, this project presents an opportunity to assist ecosystem leaders and policymakers in successfully implementing the Start-up Act. Through training based on lessons learned from the roadmap, the project seeks to help these critical stakeholders identify the start-up ecosystem&apos;s challenges, opportunities, and how they can personally contribute to its success.</narrative>
  </description>
